<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PathoGenesis started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PathoGenesis started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg said analyst David Webber initiated coverage of PathoGenesis Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said expects company's lead product, TOBI for cystic fibrosis infections, to be approved by year end.</p>
<p>-- shares were off 3/8 at 30.</p>
</text>
